1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:04,810
There are a lot of traditions you can turn
to while celebrating Valentine's Day with

2
00:00:04,810 --> 00:00:06,370
your special someone.

3
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:11,070
The thing that can really ramp up the romantic
factor for couples, though, is cuddling up

4
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:14,809
on the couch to watch a nice romantic film
together.

5
00:00:14,809 --> 00:00:20,000
From exciting capers with a romantic twist
to dramas that will make you think and feel,

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,859
here's a look at some movies that are perfect
for your next Netflix and Chill session this

7
00:00:24,859 --> 00:00:26,000
Valentine's Day.

8
00:00:27,245 --> 00:00:32,051
Sometimes young love just needs a nudge, and
that's exactly what happens in To All the

9
00:00:32,051 --> 00:00:33,690
Boys I've Loved Before.

10
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:40,070
Based on Jenny Han's book of the same name,
the 2018 film centers on Lara Jean Song Covey,

11
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:44,649
a teen who makes peace with her unrequited
crushes by writing them letters and then putting

12
00:00:44,649 --> 00:00:46,400
them away in a memory box.

13
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:51,789
But when her younger sister finds those notes
and decides to send them out, Lara Jean suddenly

14
00:00:51,789 --> 00:00:55,564
