15
00:00:55,822 --> 00:00:56,701
...eventually.

16
00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:11,470
When Peter Kavinsky comes to talk to her about
his letter, Lara Jean hatches a plan to pretend-date

17
00:01:11,470 --> 00:01:16,470
