27
00:01:50,009 --> 00:01:53,672
"Oh my God, what did you do?"

28
00:01:53,672 --> 00:01:55,734
"Oh, oh, no no no no no no."

29
00:01:55,734 --> 00:01:57,144
"This isn't what it looks like."

30
00:01:57,144 --> 00:01:57,810
"We didn't kill him."

31
00:01:57,810 --> 00:01:59,890
"You hit him with your car, man."

32
