33
00:02:05,780 --> 00:02:08,950
and, of course, plenty more murders.

34
00:02:08,950 --> 00:02:14,120
Equal parts caper and romance, this movie
is perfect for rom-com fans who prefer some

35
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,710
