36
00:02:17,849 --> 00:02:20,310
Love doesn't always happen on a schedule.

37
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:26,319
In the 2019 romantic comedy Always Be My Maybe,
Ali Wong and Randall Park star as Sasha and

38
00:02:26,319 --> 00:02:30,340
Marcus, two friends who were always inseparable
