52
00:03:19,787 --> 00:03:24,459
Sometimes the person you're looking for has
been right under your nose the whole time.

53
00:03:24,459 --> 00:03:28,590
In The Kissing Booth, we meet Elle Evans,
a teen who has a lifelong friendship with

54
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:34,230
Lee Flynn - and a major crush on his handsome
