other admirers around the school.

57
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:48,470
As Elle and Lee work together to stage a Kissing
Booth fundraiser at the fair, Elle's feelings

58
00:03:48,470 --> 00:03:53,400
for Noah grow, and she gets a major surprise
