As Noah begins to return her affections, Elle's
friendship with Lee is strained, and she must

61
00:04:01,350 --> 00:04:04,370
decide whether some rules are meant to be
broken.

62
00:04:04,370 --> 00:04:08,780
"Just don't end up grinding coochies with
my brother or I'll literally never talk to

63
00:04:08,780 --> 00:04:09,557
you again."

64
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:15,340
Even online dating services have to come with
