65
00:04:15,340 --> 00:04:20,130
In the romantic comedy Love, Guaranteed, we
meet an attorney named Susan, who accepts

66
00:04:20,130 --> 00:04:21,530
a very strange case.

67
00:04:21,530 --> 00:04:27,410
Her new client Nick has been on 986 dates
through a service that promises a true connection,

68
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:30,727
