69
00:04:30,727 --> 00:04:36,189
"986 dates with actual human women?"

70
00:04:36,356 --> 00:04:37,356
"Yes."

71
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:41,870
As Susan works with Nick to prove his case
against the company, the two find that they

72
00:04:41,870 --> 00:04:45,010
