78
00:05:04,361 --> 00:05:05,770
"Well, wish me luck."

79
00:05:05,770 --> 00:05:06,990
"Hardly seems appropriate."

80
00:05:09,616 --> 00:05:13,566
"Right…'cause the case."

81
00:05:13,566 --> 00:05:14,462
"Right."

82
00:05:15,039 --> 00:05:20,120
The concept of a romantic getaway gets an
all-new meaning in Holiday in the Wild.

83
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:24,600
The film introduces us to New York native
Kate Conrad as she heads out for an African

84
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,730
