the couple at the center of it all.

103
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:46,310
When it comes to romance, it's important to
keep an open mind.

104
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:50,889
That's certainly true when it comes to Kenneth
Calloway in Safety Not Guaranteed.

105
00:06:50,889 --> 00:06:56,620
Kenneth is such an eccentric man that he becomes
the subject of a full-on journalistic investigation

106
00:06:56,620 --> 00:07:01,548
