107
00:07:01,912 --> 00:07:04,572
"He's looking for someone to go back in time
with him.

108
00:07:04,572 --> 00:07:07,530
Do a little tongue-in-cheek investigation.

109
00:07:07,530 --> 00:07:10,538
Find this guy, see if he thinks it's real
or just a prank."

110
00:07:11,069 --> 00:07:15,699
One of the interns covering the story is Darius,
